### name: agg.snapshot.overwrite-later-element-map
--- note
The body overwrites a LATER child of the list it is visiting. The snapshot still visits it as it was. Hosts split three and three: cpp/js/python answered 99, php/lisp/go answered the old value; entries-backed records were live in Go only.
--- source
A = LIST(1, 2, 3); MAP(A, IF(_K == "1", (A[3] = 99), _)) .> JOIN(",")
--- expect
text "99,2,3"
===
### name: agg.snapshot.overwrite-later-element-sum
--- note
The body overwrites a LATER child of the list it is visiting. The snapshot still visits it as it was. Hosts split three and three: cpp/js/python answered 99, php/lisp/go answered the old value; entries-backed records were live in Go only.
--- source
A = LIST(1, 2, 3); SUM(A, IF(_K == "1", (A[3] = 99), _))
--- expect
num 104
===
